{"meta":{"id":"completable-future","category":"it/syntax/java/network","title":"CompletableFuture (Promise 대응) · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"thenApply · exceptionally · join, allOf 병렬 처리","tags":["java","f-async"],"color":"sky","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-sky","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-sky-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-sky-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-sky-50 text-sky-700 border border-sky-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">CompletableFuture (Promise 대응) · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-sky-50/70 border border-sky-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-sky-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> thenApply · exceptionally · join, allOf 병렬 처리</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">CompletableFuture — Promise 대응</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">CompletableFuture&lt;User&gt; userF = CompletableFuture.supplyAsync(() -&gt; getUser(1));\r\n\r\nuserF.thenApply(User::getName)          // .then()\r\n     .exceptionally(e -&gt; &quot;unknown&quot;)     // .catch()\r\n     .thenAccept(System.out::println);\r\n\r\nUser u = userF.join();                  // await 처럼 결과 기다리기 (블로킹)</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-sky-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">allOf — Promise.all 대응</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">var a = CompletableFuture.supplyAsync(() -&gt; getUser(1));\r\nvar b = CompletableFuture.supplyAsync(() -&gt; getOrders(1));\r\n\r\nCompletableFuture.allOf(a, b).join();   // 모두 끝날 때까지 (하나 실패 시 예외)\r\nUser user = a.join();\r\nList&lt;Order&gt; orders = b.join();</pre></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">JS 와 달리 실제 <strong>다른 스레드</strong>에서 병렬 실행</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-sky-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">실패해도 이미 실행된 DB 작업은 롤백되지 않음 — 트랜잭션은 @Transactional 범위로 관리</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › Promise.all, Python › asyncio.gather</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/network/completable-future","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"network","title":"통신","path":"it/syntax/java/network"}],"hasImage":false}